{"tmdb":611412,"tagline":"","synopsis":"In the remotest corner of southern Taiwan, the sinking fisherman´s village prepares for another carnival for the god. Sheng, a man reaching his 30s, returns in disguise as an established urban elite. As the carnival escalates, Sheng confronts his persistent father who farms oysters throughout his life and the childhood buddy who always envies his fragile “successfulness.”","directors":[{"name":"Lim Lung-yin","id":2348189}],"cast":[{"actor":"Lin Yu-hsu","role":"Sheng","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3Ztp6PYXXYgQTKi5s49PIQGMt2r.jpg","tmdb":2977271},{"actor":"Chen Hsin-tai","role":"Kun","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tiNpP5haa1W2kGuc3OPsAdblhz5.jpg","tmdb":2977272},{"actor":"King Jieh-wen","role":"Ming","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lZWdwrjVBlkWoRcm9PrNUBQgmLX.jpg","tmdb":1190970},{"actor":"Yi-Ping Lan","role":"Mother","photo":null,"tmdb":4822444},{"actor":"Wu Mei-he","role":"Grandma","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nEMsdXywTkTrvxIUgp9A7fXNlp0.jpg","tmdb":2409205}],"trailers":[],"official":null,"watch":{"TW":{"f":[159],"r":[159]}},"artwork":{"posters":[["/jAO8Y0z3RQsSkvPtOmkx8FpZ7kD.jpg",1000,1426],["/rhIFbTSIEvRBU5IHSNRg47IcDTz.jpg",672,956],["/3ADYj1uWTBT1PjHEG7WW2tMrqs7.jpg",640,960]],"backdrops":[],"logos":[]}}